scripts/activity-feed-browser-check.mjs.header:
Attention: Activity feed, Later (saved messages), Mark unread, and the
read-horizon "New messages" divider. Real browser + local HTTP service;
all identities, messages, and keys are disposable fixtures.

scripts/docs-link-check.mjs.header:
Intra-repo markdown links in the maintained docs. docs/history/ is a
record and is not checked. Concurrent batches own a few linked filenames;
a missing one of those is reported and does not fail this check.

server/membership-delegation-journal.mjs.header:
Append-only, per-room hash-chain for owner membership delegation decisions.
Hashes detect damaged/reordered rows and disagreement with the live grants;
without an external anchor they cannot authenticate a privileged database rewrite.
